@startuml
title Leave request approval - Business flow (medium)
|Employee|
|Manager|
|HR|
|System|
|Employee|
start
:Submit leave request;
|System|
:Check remaining leave balance;
if (Enough balance?) then (yes)
  |Manager|
  :Review request;
  if (Approve and more than 5 days?) then (yes)
    |HR|
    :HR final review;
  endif
  |System|
  :Save decision;
  if (Approved?) then (yes)
    :Deduct balance;
    :Update team calendar;
  endif
else (no)
  :Reject automatically;
endif
:Send result email;
|Employee|
:Receive result;
stop
@enduml
